A) stove drip trays (food debris/splash);
B) lower shelf of steam table (general buildup);
C) wood brackets/shelves beneath cooking equipment (carbon/general buildup);   and
D) under flat grill (food debris/dust).

Clean non-food contact surfaces as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
